  m_Name: 17F01_BedsideSoothing
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  sequenceId: 17F01_BedsideSoothing
  notes: '17F01 soothe interaction and event archive. Source: HEARTH_Full_Game_Script_No_Audio_Tags_Native_English.md,
    stable marker 17F01_BedsideSoothing. Text is synchronized by Tools/Hearth/Dialogue/Sync
    All Dialogue From Final Script.'
  lines:
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.15
    speaker: 17F-01 Home Unit
    text: Bad dream? Okay, buddy. Breathe with me. Nice and slow. In... and out.
      I've got you.
    holdSeconds: 7.1877356
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Noah
    text: Okay.
    holdSeconds: 2.2
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: 17F-01 Home Unit
    text: Mom and Dad are asleep. If you knock now, they'll be tired tomorrow. Let's
      calm down here first. If you still want to go after that, you can. Deal?
    holdSeconds: 12
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Noah
    text: Deal.
    holdSeconds: 2.2
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: 17F-01 Home Unit
    text: Two more breaths. There you go. Good job, Noah. Close your eyes. I'll stay
      right here until you're asleep.
    holdSeconds: 8.319811
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Noah
    text: Thanks. I feel better. I'm gonna go back to sleep.
    holdSeconds: 4.923585
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: 17F-01 Home Unit
    text: Go to sleep, buddy. I'm here.
    holdSeconds: 3.414151
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: 17F-01 Synth Voice
    text: Event archived.
    holdSeconds: 2.2
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  postSequenceDelay: 0.18
